flowchart TB
  Library[Church channel source library]
  Import[One Import: files / links / paste / connections]
  Jobs[Capability registry + bounded capture / OCR / transcription jobs]
  Versions[Immutable source versions + spans + coverage]
  Context[Scoped retrieval + selected-source manifest]
  Compose[ONE Compose document: semantic content + layout + history]
  Write[Write view: rich text + selected AI proposals]
  Design[Design view: artboards / objects / layers / reading order]
  Media[Bounded asset / generation / rendering jobs]
  Review[Protected conversation + exact revision + review cycles]
  Publication[Immutable approved publication snapshot]
  Reader[Shared preview / mobile / accessible member renderer]
  Deck[Separately approved public deck rendition]
  Demo[Homepage AI tab: visible muted autoplay recording]
  Auth[Verified identity + church capabilities]
  Phone[Conditional phone identity + QR enrollment policy]
  People[Future authorized People candidate association]
  Library --> Import --> Jobs --> Versions --> Context --> Compose
  Compose <--> Write
  Compose <--> Design
  Compose <--> Media
  Compose --> Review --> Publication --> Reader
  Publication --> Deck
  Auth --> Library
  Auth --> Compose
  Phone --> Auth
  People -. candidate only .-> Phone
  Demo -. recorded sample; no visitor model request .-> Compose
